From: Xios Project <xios@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Guard WKBundle testing viewport API by its feature

The iPhone SDK defines TARGET_OS_IPHONE even for the GTK port, while GTK does
not enable META_VIEWPORT. Keep the C API call under the same feature guard as
the WebPage method it invokes.

--- a/Source/WebKit/WebProcess/InjectedBundle/API/c/WKBundlePage.cpp
+++ b/Source/WebKit/WebProcess/InjectedBundle/API/c/WKBundlePage.cpp
@@ -727,1 +727,1 @@
-#if TARGET_OS_IPHONE
+#if TARGET_OS_IPHONE && ENABLE(META_VIEWPORT)
